<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">YOUR OWN LEARNING PACE</view><view class="heading">看见每一点进步</view><view class="card profile-card" style="margin-top:30rpx" bindtap="login"><view class="avatar">{{initial}}</view><view><view class="profile-name">{{user.name || '学习体验官'}}</view><view class="profile-email">{{user.email || '点击登录，留住每一点进步 →'}}</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在整理学习记录…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button class="secondary retry" bindtap="refresh">重新加载</button></view><block wx:else><view class="stats"><view class="stat"><view class="stat-label">累计练习</view><view class="stat-value">{{stats.attemptsCount}}<text>道</text></view></view><view class="stat"><view class="stat-label">练习正确率</view><view class="stat-value">{{stats.accuracy}}<text>%</text></view></view><view class="stat"><view class="stat-label">错题掌握率</view><view class="stat-value">{{stats.percent}}<text>%</text></view></view><view class="stat"><view class="stat-label">连续学习</view><view class="stat-value">{{stats.streak}}<text>天</text></view></view></view><view class="card"><view class="panel-title">近 7 天的学习节奏</view><view class="panel-note">每天一点点，积累看得见。</view><view class="bar-chart"><view wx:for="{{stats.days}}" wx:key="label" class="bar-col"><text class="bar-count">{{item.count}}</text><view class="bar-track"><view class="bar" style="height:{{item.height}}%"/></view><text class="bar-label">{{item.label}}</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{!stats.attemptsCount}}" class="subtitle">完成首次练习后，就会出现学习轨迹。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="panel-title">各学科掌握情况</view><view wx:for="{{stats.distribution}}" wx:key="name" class="distribution"><view class="row"><text class="distribution-label">{{item.name}}</text><text class="distribution-count">{{item.mastered}} / {{item.count}} 道已掌握</text></view><view class="progress-track"><view class="progress-fill {{item.color}}" style="width:{{item.width}}%"/></view></view></view></block><view class="card"><view class="list-item row" bindtap="exportData"><text>{{exporting ? '正在导出…' : '导出并分享学习数据'}}</text><text>↗</text></view><view class="list-item row" bindtap="help"><text>使用指南</text><text>›</text></view><view wx:if="{{user}}" class="list-item row" bindtap="logout"><text>{{loggingOut ? '正在退出…' : '退出登录'}}</text><text>›</text></view></view><view class="footnote">进步有自己的节奏，日拱一卒，功不唐捐。</view></view>
